<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="63f86e91">&lt;p&gt;
    Designed help project teams consider the impact of a proposed change on the project. The considerations defined below
    are for guidance only and are not definitive. Professional judgment is needed to determine the impact relevant to each
    project.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table title=&quot;&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;2&quot; width=&quot;85%&quot; border=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
    &lt;tbody&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot; abbr=&quot;&quot;&gt;
                Area
            &lt;/th&gt;
            &lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot; abbr=&quot;&quot;&gt;
                Project impact considerations
            &lt;/th&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                People
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                &lt;ul&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        How does the proposed change impact the current project team structure, skills, competencies, and
                        resource plan?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Is there a requirement to use subject matter resources (SMRs)?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Are SMRs and/or additional resources available to meet the client’s schedule?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        How will our roles and responsibilities change?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        How will the client sponsor’s roles and responsibilities change?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        What additional training or awareness is needed and how will it be delivered?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Who are the key stakeholders (EY and client) associated with the change?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        How will the change requirement be communicated to these key stakeholders?&lt;br /&gt;
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;/ul&gt;
            &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Process and Technology
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                &lt;ul&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Does the change introduce a requirement to use a different service methodology?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        How does the change impact our reports and work products?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        How does the change impact the project timeline?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Do we need to use additional technology tools to satisfy the change requirement?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        What measures may be used to track the effective implementation of change?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        What would the impact be of introducing these measures on management overhead/ status reporting?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;/ul&gt;
            &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Policy and Governance
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                &lt;ul&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        How does the proposed change influence overall engagement risk?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Does the change requirement place the work outside our scope of services?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Do we need to re-perform projectt acceptance and re-consider our objectivity and independence?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        What impact is there on project documentation and the level of supervision and review?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        What is the impact on quality assurance?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Does the change require us to re-issue the engagement agreement (or issue an addendum to the
                        engagement agreement)?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;/ul&gt;
            &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
        &lt;tr&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                Financial
            &lt;/td&gt;
            &lt;td&gt;
                &lt;ul&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        How does the change influence project costs and recovery?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        How does the engagement fee and budget need to be revised?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        What are the constraints, dependencies and assumptions underlying the revised budget?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        How does the change influence project costs for the client?
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                &lt;/ul&gt;
            &lt;/td&gt;
        &lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;</attribute>
